  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Kanban Board is an agile project management control for visualizing and managing work items using a card-based, columnar layout. It supports features like swimlanes, WIP (Work In Progress) limits, drag-and-drop card movement, card templates, custom column headers, stacked headers, filtering, searching, sorting, dialog editing, and responsive design. It is ideal for agile sprint planning, task tracking, and project workflow management in ASP.NET Core applications.",
